      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IT'S BUBBLE TIME (7) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Was too tough when scoring last time over 390m at Ballarat in a Grade 5 (22.08). Form at the trip strong including 10 wins. Expected to be right there at the finish again. STAR MELI (1) was in the money again last time and not beaten far when third (22.46) at this track in a Grade 5. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. MISS MY BROTHER (2) pinged the lids and led throughout to score last start (24.25) at Bendigo in Grade 5 NP over 425m. The form out of last race has been strong. Can measure up again. PAW INFLAME (5) gave nothing else a chance most recently. Must be respected.",
